<title>USA: Cedar Rapids, Iowa, won by Hutchinson Shockey.</title>
<headline>Cedar Rapids, Iowa, won by Hutchinson Shockey.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hutchinson Shockey said it won $15.100 million of Cedar Rapids, Iowa, general obligation bonds, Series 1997 B, with a true interest cost of 5.0658 percent.</p>
